Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:41:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/16] ntoskrnl.exe: Add functions the KMDF runtime imports,
 and implement PoRequestPowerIrp.

Six functions the Kernel-Mode Driver Framework imports were not exported,
so its image did not load: EtwActivityIdControl (no event tracing: fails),
IoUnregisterPlugPlayNotificationEx, IoWMIDeviceObjectToProviderId,
KeSetCoalescableTimer (a timer without coalescing), PoGetSystemWake and
PoSetSystemWake (no system wake).

PoRequestPowerIrp returned STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED. A power-policy owner,
the framework among them, requests the device's D0 with it when the device
starts. Build the power IRP, send it to the top of the device's stack and
call the requester's completion callback.
